<p>The following code snippet displays a message box saying "Hello, World!" as the window loads:
</p>
<div class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-vbnet mw-content-ltr" dir="ltr"><pre><span></span><span class="k">Private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">Form_Load</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="c">' Execute a simple message box that says "Hello, World!"</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="hll"><span class="w">    </span><span class="n">MsgBox</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">"Hello, World!"</span><span class="w"></span>
</span><span class="k">End</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"></span>
</pre></div>
<p>This snippet makes a counter that moves up 1 every second (a label and a timer control need to be added to the form for this to work) until the form is closed or an <a href="https://m.marefa.org/w/index.php?title=Integer_overflow&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Integer overflow (Ø§Ù„ØµÙØ­Ø© ØºÙŠØ± Ù…ÙˆØ¬ÙˆØ¯Ø©)">integer overflow</a> occurs:
</p>
<div class="mw-highlight mw-highlight-lang-vbnet mw-content-ltr" dir="ltr"><pre><span></span><span class="k">Option</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Explicit</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="k">Dim</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Count</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="ow">As</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">Integer</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="k">Private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">Form_Load</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="n">Count</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="n">Timer1</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">Interval</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">1000</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c">' units of milliseconds</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="k">End</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="k">Private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">Timer1_Timer</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="n">Count</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Count</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">+</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="w">    </span><span class="n">Label1</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">Caption</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Count</span><span class="w"></span>
<span class="k">End</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">Sub</span><span class="w"></span>
</pre></div>
